ximilian was executed on 19 June 1867.","u":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_French_intervention_in_Mexico"}],"certainty":[{"from":1864,"to":1867,"level":"soft","note":"The Empire claimed all Mexico but held cities and corridors; no treaty line is dated on the pages, and the frontier with the United States is the Rio Grande only as a river (the page names none)."}],"sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Mexican_Empire","title":"Second Mexican Empire"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_French_intervention_in_Mexico","title":"Second French intervention in Mexico"}]}